  "instructions": [
    "Heat ghee or clarified butter in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add lamb pieces and brown them on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add coriander powder, turmeric powder, and red chili powder. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add coconut milk and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Add basmati rice and stir gently to combine.",
